<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent incidents continue in Mexico, including a small plane crash that killed the pilot and co-pilot shortly after takeoff, and the escape of a California inmate wanted for killing a Mexican police commander in a shootout. An ICE officer was indicted for running over an undocumented Mexican immigrant, while a Chinese citizen was convicted of drug trafficking linked to the Jalisco New Generation Cartel. Mexico deployed 450 troops to Matamoros in response to recent violence and faces parental resistance to a school cellphone ban over safety concerns. A Mexican priest recovered after being kidnapped, and Tzotzil women documented patriarchal violence in a new review. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQWHdKWlJZdHFraFJJd2RRSEwydFJmOTlGbDBGbGc3WjhWMzVZWDBJZ1hQeGY2SmJTZHdPWi0tV2Viendab2VOcW9rSWMzY19iSlY5Skt6aTA2MWhQV051ZnY0LXA2eXUwZ1I4ejUyaF9vMDRDQ2J2Y1Zib25tOTEzYUt5SFlJdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;cbs8.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQTjhvQUNDemFWcm1qaXo5eU5rbGpRX3Viak5abnp1X3lsWEVmM3I3WFVXdXExOVE5NDN4VjdCcGdqMjRDSEd0WV9rYnZjS1VZMWlxU0p2Y0lhX2RHUk5wOUFPOFhFZUhjSDItQ0VKTkdBZ2M2WjVQRDdIRlo3R1FaVEE0S1gwcmZ5ZjZGLWJYUkJsT1dEdnd0ZzY1aFhLR29ZWkxmazJJc2l2T0tX?oc=5&quot;&gt;People.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPY0RfS3JmdEtteW15RW5ndlVhQnM5SDIyWVV3NWhiYTRrNjJVWmtia2lkZ0taNlVhcW1GNjNRcDdjLTc1Q3UxS2NPRjl5WDBabkpoTEdwaFZkYklxaDJ3b1hxQmdaVnBvMFJfdEtrX25xejlxTjBlblkyU3IxcVFWb0htT0c0bVJHbnl2eHVkS29